WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.302
A central ablation studies the smoothing variance sigma.

00:00:04.382 --> 00:00:08.684
On Freeway,

00:00:08.764 --> 00:00:13.066
robustness for the strong methods keeps improving
as sigma grows all the way to one point zero,

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:17.448
since Freeway tolerates large noise.

00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:21.830
On Pong the story differs: too much smoothing hurts,

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:26.212
and a moderate sigma between about zero point zero
one and zero point zero three works best for nearly all methods.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:30.594
The authors also compare their three reward bounds.

00:00:30.674 --> 00:00:34.976
The percentile bound is far tighter than the loose
expectation bound,

00:00:35.056 --> 00:00:39.358
and the absolute lower bound from CROP-LoRe often
matches the empirical reward under PGD attack exactly,

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:43.740
a zero gap that demonstrates the certificates are
tight rather than merely valid.
